            "title": "Zero Sugar<br>Ashwagandha+ Gummies",
            "copy": "Made with clinically studied KSM-66® Ashwagandha, L-Theanine, and Maca to help reduce stress, support sleep quality, and enhance focus — all in a delicious zero sugar gummy you’ll enjoy adding to your routine.",
            "support_label": "Helps support:",
            "support_1": "Stress Relief & Relaxation",
            "support_2": "Sleep Quality",
            "support_3": "Focus & Cognitive Health",
            "image_files": "product-ash-1.jpg,product-ash-2.jpg,product-ash-3.jpg,product-ash-4.jpg,product-ash-5.jpg,product-ash-6.jpg,product-ash-7.jpg,product-ash-8.jpg,product-ash-9.jpg,product-ash-10.jpg"
